    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispering Stacks is a cozy, rogue-lite side-scrolling zap-em-up where you play a wizard trying really hard to study at the library while its magical inhabitants do everything in their power to stop you</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zap your way through a randomly generated library full of magical foes, on your quest for arcane knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stylish outfits you totally didn't steal from a giant moth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own cozy reading nook where you can relax after a long day of fighting mythical creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend virtual companions and invite them to stay in your reading nook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mysterious artefacts like the Divination of Tranquility tarot deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run in terror from the librarians</p></li></ul>",
